@startuml
title Order State Machine
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F1FB
  BorderColor #2463A6
}
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Placed : Place order
Placed --> Confirmed : Payment confirmed
Placed --> Cancelled : Cancel before payment
Confirmed --> Processing : Fulfillment started
Confirmed --> Cancelled : Cancel before shipment
Processing --> Shipped : All vendor orders shipped
Processing --> Cancelled : Cancel before shipment
Shipped --> Delivered : Delivery confirmed
Shipped --> Returned : Return requested
Delivered --> Returned : Return requested
Delivered --> Refunded : Refund completed
Returned --> Refunded : Refund completed
Cancelled --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
@enduml
